    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Marine Lodge- a fine, mature,  bungalow of approx. 112m2 and set on a sun-drenched site in a prime residential area. Available exclusively through Lynam Auctioneers, this delightful residence offers an exceptional opportunity for comfortable living and is perfectly positioned just a short stroll from Killiney beach and the DART.\r\n\r\nUpon entry, accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a charming living room filled with natural light. The living room opens via double doors to a separate dining area off the kitchen. The kitchen provides a sociable space with a kitchen island and access to the rear gardens. There are also 4 well appointed bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe location of Marine lodge is second to none. The stunning Killiney beach is a few minutes walk away.  The villages of Dalkey, Kiliney and Shankill are also close by offering a host of amenities including shops, cafes and restaurants and Killiney DART station offers access to the nearby villages and the city centre. The area also boasts a fantastic selection of primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nMarine Lodge offers the discerning purchaser the opportunity to own a beautiful home in a highly sought after location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: c. 4.60m x 6.18m\r\n\r\nLiving room: c. 4.47m x 5.39m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: c. 3.69m x 5.81m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 3.43m x 2.47m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.43m x 3.86m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 3.69m x 3.60m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: c. 2.52m x 2.61m\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 2.52m x 2.14m\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
      {
